    "ssky_faqs_3Qemgx": {
      "type": "ssky-faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_UKnEdr": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Order Questions</p>",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "heading_weight": "bold"
          }
        },
        "faq_RegETV": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>How long will it take to receive my books after ordering?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Packages are usually processed by our warehouse in 3-5 business days, and our shipping partners offers a window of 5-7 business once the package is transferred to them.  This creates a shipping window of 8-10 business days from when your order is placed.  We cannot control delays caused by weather or shipping partner complications but we do our best to package your products in a timely manner.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_QTTPt8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Where can I find my digital downloads I ordered?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>The links to your digital files are included in your order confirmation email sent after purchase.  They appear as blue hyperlinks that you can click on to download those files.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_rT9Wyg": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I am having issues downloading digital files I ordered. Can you please help?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Here are some helpful hints we have for people as they are working with the downloads. I hope these can help!<br/><br/>Tips that may work well to retrieve the files. All computers have different settings, so we have a few suggestions.<br/><br/>When you click on the link it will download the file to your computer rather than opening it up on a new window. If you are having a hard time finding it try going to your computer’s “settings” and then “downloads” and you should find the file(s) there. Sometimes it is helpful to copy/paste the link in your browser.<br/><br/>Open the link using a different browser.<br/><br/>Take the email to your local printshop and ask them to print the files for you.<br/><br/>Save the link onto a USB drive and open it on a different computer.<br/><br/>For downloading your audio files to iTunes:<br/></p><ol><li>Open iTunes</li><li>Click File Menu and select “Add to Library”</li><li>Find the files you would like to add</li><li>Add the selected files to your iTunes.</li><li>Click the music button and open your library.</li><li>Find your newly added files in your library and press play.</li></ol>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_RJ9U8M": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Do you ship outside the U.S.?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>We do ship outside the U.S.! You should be able to add the items to your cart and proceed to a placed to  enter your shipping information.  Shipping for your package is calculated based on the weight of the items and your destination address.  <br/><br/>NOTE: This does not include our magazine subscription. Our mail house for the magazine doesn’t have the capability to ship internationally. We might look at a PDF only version for our international customers, but that is not an option just yet.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_rhqGwr": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>What should I do if my package is damaged or incorrect?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>If your package is damaged or incorrect, please send us an email with your order number as well as photo documentation of the damage/received books. We will do our best to get you the correct, undamaged books in a timely manner.  Sending a photo helps us verify your new order is correct, and how we can improve our packaging for the future.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_PWDbhi": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>What is the return/refund process?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>If you do not want to keep the books you can send them back to us and, once they are received, we can issue a refund for the books or an exchange for a different set.  We are happy to work with you through the process.  We do not cover the cost of return postage.<br/><br/><strong>Please send them to: <br/></strong>659 N Saratoga Rd, Suite 355 <br/>Saratoga Springs, Utah 84045<br/><br/>To help connect us with your order, please include a note with your name, order number, and email address so we can identify your order. You can find your order details on the confirmation email you received after placing the order.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_jWne3d": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>How can I place a bulk order?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Please email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@tuttletwins.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@tuttletwins.com\">info@tuttletwins.com</a> or contact us through our customer service form so we can send you more information about ordering in bulk.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
